{"id":"c3d365fa2f7a9d0f","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-lattice-ops.md","title":"c.e. 格运算与商运算","display":"df-lattice-ops — c.e. 格运算与商运算","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-lattice-ops","aliases":["20-df-lattice-ops"],"display":"df-lattice-ops — c.e. 格运算与商运算","chapter":"2","section":"2.1","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"§2.1.7 的 lattice","source_pdf_pages":[63],"source_printed_pages":[27],"depends_on":["[[20-df-lattice-re]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-lattice-ops"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-lattice-ops</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-lattice-ops — c.e. 格运算与商运算"},{"key":"chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"section","html":"2.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"§2.1.7 的 lattice"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>63</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2db5f72c1596f66e\" href=\"?note=2db5f72c1596f66e\" title=\"20-df-lattice-re\">20-df-lattice-re</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathcal E\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathcal E\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2db5f72c1596f66e\" href=\"?note=2db5f72c1596f66e\" title=\"20-df-lattice-re\">20-df-lattice-re</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lattice\\text{-}ops}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nA\\vee_{\\mathbb E}B:=A\\cup B,\\quad A\\wedge_{\\mathbb E}B:=A\\cap B,\\quad\n0_{\\mathbb E}:=\\varnothing,\\quad1_{\\mathbb E}:=\\omega,\\\\\n[A]^*\\vee[B]^*:=[A\\cup B]^*,\\qquad\n[A]^*\\wedge[B]^*:=[A\\cap B]^*.\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lattice\\text{-}ops}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nA\\vee_{\\mathbb E}B:=A\\cup B,\\quad A\\wedge_{\\mathbb E}B:=A\\cap B,\\quad\n0_{\\mathbb E}:=\\varnothing,\\quad1_{\\mathbb E}:=\\omega,\\\\\n[A]^*\\vee[B]^*:=[A\\cup B]^*,\\qquad\n[A]^*\\wedge[B]^*:=[A\\cap B]^*.\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>并交的闭包及上下界性质给出有界格。商运算的代表元无关性由有限对称差的并／交界给出。集合并不等同于 degree join；后者采用有效不交编码。</p>\n<p>来源：§2.1.7 的 lattice；印刷页 27；PDF 第 63 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-lattice-re","status":"resolved","id":"2db5f72c1596f66e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-lattice-re]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-lattice-re","status":"resolved","id":"2db5f72c1596f66e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-lattice-re]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lattice\\text{-}ops}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nA\\vee_{\\mathbb E}B:=A\\cup B,\\quad A\\wedge_{\\mathbb E}B:=A\\cap B,\\quad\n0_{\\mathbb E}:=\\varnothing,\\quad1_{\\mathbb E}:=\\omega,\\\\\n[A]^*\\vee[B]^*:=[A\\cup B]^*,\\qquad\n[A]^*\\wedge[B]^*:=[A\\cap B]^*.\n\\end{gathered}","display":true}],"bytes":1148,"backlinks":[{"id":"da818d16195851b8","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depe